title: Global shell › Sidebar › Authorizations group and green highlight
route: Any address (the sidebar reads the address after every change)
intro: Two rules decide what the sidebar looks like. First, whether the Authorizations group shows its two sub rows. Second, which single row turns green. There is no collapse button: the group follows the address.
dir: LR
---
start s1 "The address changes\n(a click, a link, a redirect or the browser Back button)"
decision d1 "Does the address start with /authorizations?"
process open "Group is open\n'New case' and 'Eligibility & Benefits' are listed under 'Authorizations'\nChevron points down"
process shut "Group is closed\nThe two sub rows are hidden\nChevron points right"

group gHi "Which row is green"
  decision d2 "Which address is it?"
  process h1 "'Authorizations' turns green\nAddress is exactly /authorizations, or a case: /authorizations/case/..."
  process h2 "'New case' turns green, 'Authorizations' stays plain\n/authorizations/new, a draft, or a referral"
  process h3 "'Eligibility & Benefits' turns green, 'Authorizations' stays plain\n/authorizations/eligibility, /verify or a result"
  process h4 "'Dashboard' turns green\n/dashboard (also when the address has ?request=)"
  process h5 "'Denial Intelligence' turns green\n/denials and a brief under it"
  process h6 "'Case Manager' turns green\n/manager, either tab (the old /active also lands here)"
  process h7 "'Analytics', 'EMR Connect' or 'Payers' turns green\n/analytics, /emr, /payers and a payer under it"
  process h8 "'Settings' in the footer turns green\n/settings"
  process h9 "No row is green\nAn address that is not part of the demo"
endgroup

group gClick "Clicks that change the group"
  click c1 "Click 'Authorizations' while on a sub page"
  process r1 "Go to /authorizations\nGroup stays open, 'Authorizations' turns green"
  click c2 "Click any row outside the group\n(for example 'Dashboard')"
  process r2 "Group closes: the address no longer starts with /authorizations"
endgroup

end e1 "Exactly one row is green at a time"

s1 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| open
d1 -->|No| shut
open & shut --> d2
d2 -->|/authorizations or a case| h1
d2 -->|New case pages| h2
d2 -->|Eligibility pages| h3
d2 -->|/dashboard| h4
d2 -->|/denials| h5
d2 -->|/manager| h6
d2 -->|Analytics, EMR, Payers| h7
d2 -->|/settings| h8
d2 -->|Anything else| h9
h1 & h2 & h3 & h4 & h5 & h6 & h7 & h8 & h9 --> e1
open --> c1 --> r1 --> e1
open --> c2 --> r2 --> e1
